# Destiny Post-Session Sweeper Bot: Bungie credentials
# COPY THIS FILE TO .env AND FILL IN THE VALUES.
# The .env file is ignored by git, this file is a template.

# Get these from https://www.bungie.net/en/Application (new app or an existing one)
# 1. Application Status: Private.
# 2. OAuth Client Type: Confidential (the only type that gets refresh tokens).
# 3. Redirect URL: https://localhost:6821/callback
# 4. Scope: check exactly these two boxes:
#    - "Read your Destiny 2 information (Vault, Inventory, and Vendors), as well
#      as Destiny 1 Vault and Inventory data."
#    - "Move or equip Destiny gear and other items."
# 5. Leave Origin Header blank (it is only for browser-based apps).
# 6. Save Changes, then copy the API Key, OAuth client_id, and OAuth
#    client_secret here.

BUNGIE_API_KEY=your_api_key_here
BUNGIE_CLIENT_ID=your_client_id_here
BUNGIE_CLIENT_SECRET=your_client_secret_here
BUNGIE_REDIRECT_URI=https://localhost:6821/callback
